// ============================================================
// Normal spellbook - Magic Dart (1). Simplification flagged to Corey: real OSRS also requires a
// Slayer's staff equipped to cast this at all (separate from the level check) - not implemented here,
// only the level(50)+rune check applies.
// ============================================================

