data=spotanim_proj,slayer_magicdart_travel
data=spotanim_target,slayer_magicdart_impact
data=continue_by_autocast,yes
data=rune,mindrune,4
data=rune,deathrune,1

// ============================================================
// Ancient Magicks (16) - real OSRS release 27 Sept 2005. Icons/travel/impact spotanims and rune
// objects all confirmed directly against all.obj/all.seq/all.spotanim. Two things are NOT verifiable
// from this repo and are flagged rather than guessed:
//   - spellcom is left empty on every row here: the real magic:<name> component id for each ancient
//     spell can't be identified (no raw interface source, only unlabeled magic:com_NN entries) - see
//     claude/ancient-magicks.md. Fine because spellcom is only read for autocast re-triggering, and
//     every row below has continue_by_autocast=false or is cast directly via the ::cast dev command,
//     never through the (unidentifiable) real interface component.
//   - anim (the player's cast animation) uses human_castwave as a placeholder: no dedicated ancient-cast
//     animation tag exists anywhere in all.seq for this cache snapshot. Real OSRS has a distinct
//     two-handed ancient magicks cast animation; this repo's raw dump doesn't have it, so the closest
//     real, confirmed-existing generic spellcasting animation is substituted. Swap out if the real tag
//     turns up.
// Burst/Barrage tier "3x3 AoE" is NOT implemented - these spells work as single-target only against
// the clicked npc for now (same damage/freeze/heal/poison as their tier, just not multi-target). True
// AoE needs a "find npcs in radius" primitive this framework doesn't have yet.
// ============================================================

